Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Lilliel-chan? Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:58.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,403.2)}{\an7}First Event Is Over!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry that took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's that cutie been all this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd we miss her?\NThis event isn't that big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she just get changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's only ten minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that's True Angel Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She said Lilliel and I shrugged\Nit off for being so old...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,but look at me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this flutter in my heart,\Nas if I've just been reunited with my first crush?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every man goes through a Lilliel phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did, too, back when I wouldn't\Neven call myself an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here she is, the Lilliel I loved so dearly back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And in such a high-quality costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can never let milady Magino\Nknow these treacherous feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Lilliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was that girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cancel what I said about heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm right there with you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you want to get photos taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never done this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you start taking pictures,\Neveryone else will start, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to find a spot, first...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I take your picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a card?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's your handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you selling cosroms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino, don't you want to get pictures of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surely you're not serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare betray you, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you crying blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:04:01.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,50.4)}{\an7}SHOUT SHOUT\N{\pos(844.8,100.8)}{\an7}ARGUE ARGUE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,Lilliel! Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want you to get good pictures of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:03:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you doing photos now? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is there a line?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's not enough time to go through a whole line!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys need to ask her what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,L-Lilliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is getting crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:12.21,Q3,,0,0,0,,L-Lilliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And we're almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She needs a handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Lilliel here is ready for photos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's her first time, so let's all be extra polite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her first time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,May we use this space here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have the honor of organizing\Nthis last-minute photoshoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,To expedite things,\Nplease gather around in a semi-circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This means I'm allowed to have the best spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So he does want pictures...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop bowing!\NYou're not some disgraced CEO, Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I gotta strike a pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't squeeze in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not with this huge crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look over here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't know where to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a newbie, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have her posing down yet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wish she'd hit some classic poses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like she doesn't know what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno, her inexperience makes her so much cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-these simpletons!\NDo they know nothing about the source material?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All her poses are straight from the manga and anime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she's not just doing poses from the key art,\Nbut one-off pages and panels, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She changes it every five seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She must be doing this by heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's clearly a diehard Lilliel fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Ogino?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, she's clearly not as incredible as you, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I must admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is a display worthy of the utmost respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's your opinion,\Nas a self-proclaimed cosplay reviewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was hard to get good photos of her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,because she's not used\Nto posing for a semicircle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like she's wearing a costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Haven't heard that from you before.\NWhat does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not sure how else to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel like cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe because she feels\Nthe opposite of professional,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,it instead feels more raw?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like this is just how she always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like the real Lilliel stepped out from\Nthe pages and posed for my camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that make her perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder how I look to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can they tell how much I love Lilliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I love her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,...so, so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get as many pics as you can before\Nit's midnight and the spell wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,One more minute, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is my daughter doing\Nwith these filthy comics?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom. But they're not-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tell me this is some kind of mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,A mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\NI've gone out in public as Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nine! Eight! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.29,Q4,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nine! Eight! Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,A real otaku NEVER judges\Nsomeone by the things they love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Lilliel is the cutest in the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai gave me the courage to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Three! Two! One!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That last expression was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Definitely the cutest of the bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the loving gaze she gives\Nher darling Lord Ashford!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wish she would've looked my way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lilliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I missed my chance to get good pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I take one now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling so relieved, I'm smiling all funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was way too relaxed there!\NI wasn't in character as Lilliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can we take another?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This one came out great, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spring CosFest 19 is now officially over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The changing rooms will close at 5 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.00,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,324)}{\an7}Women's\N{\pos(499.2,374.4)}{\an7}Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, -san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want your cosrom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I buy it online?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, I don't have that set up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I post your photos online?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, please don't post them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I at least get your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gotta have a social media handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.04,Q4,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-chan, the changing room's gonna close soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't have either...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.38,Q4,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-chan, the changing room's gonna close soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No cards, no socials...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who the hell was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,A shapeshifter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,An angel, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The changing room is closing soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-chan, mind if I get one with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks like Lilliel's gotten way\Ntoo into some skeevy host.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, more like an angel's come\Nto take Akito off to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do I look dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're closing the room soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,309.6)}{\an7}Women's Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap, gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-chan, got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you take my tail off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The glue just won't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not sewn into your costume!\NYou actually have it on your tailbone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.79,0:11:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I want it to look perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Magino-chan, you still dealing with allergies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I assume that's why you've got so many masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those are for my safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've done a lot of animal-themed cosplay lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So they're for fur and dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I wonder if my lungs will give\Nout from the amount of fur I've inhaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:28.50,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,136.8)}{\an7}X-RAY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't stop cosplaying those characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always say I want to try a bunch of different genres,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but then I look in my closet and\Nit's just full of kimonos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know that feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bakiko, you're always doing\Ncharacters with horns or fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was heading home from an event once\Nand noticed a bunch of people staring at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,...'cause I'd forgotten to take my fangs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gotta be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Says the girl still wearing her elf ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, since we're all telling horror stories...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, these are horror stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,One time, I was lounging around after an event...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,...when I heard my brother screaming\Nbloody murder in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd left my wig soaking in the tub...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a horror story, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That happened to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My wig was drying and fell\Ndown on top of the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Total Sadako moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you guys all chatting about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon. It's me, Akito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's handsome even out of her cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got a scary story to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like I said, this wasn't supposed to be all scary stories...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've heard of cosplayers'\Npartners finding their wigs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and thinking they're cheating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,In my case,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,my family's always finding mens' jackets\Nand stuff hanging around my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,They know I cosplay,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they don't know\NI'm usually doing male characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not like they ask me all that much about it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So one day my mom tells me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:22.38,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,136.8)}{\an7}Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd at least break up with the\Nguy who wears those leather jackets...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they thought I was dating\Nseven different guys at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet you don't have any cosplay\Nworries just yet, Lilliel-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your skin is perfect, you're super adorable,\Nand you've got a great figure to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop flirting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're wrong, I've got plenty of worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really short, but I have big boobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and my proportions always\Nmake things harder for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, I can never find good clothes in my size!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to do all sorts of cosplays,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,but anything that isn't skin\Ntight just makes me look fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I'm probably cursed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cursed to only look good in skimpy outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:19.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,360)}{\an7}SKIN TIGHT!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Outfits I'm too embarrassed to wear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.21,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,453.6)}{\an7}MIDRIFF EXPOSED,\N{\pos(358.4,504)}{\an7}T&A ON DISPLAY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your outfit was really cute today, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cheated. I had a professional help me pick this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:31.46,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,424.8)}{\an7}professional
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.50,Q4,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cheated. I had a professional help me pick this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I cheated. I had a professional help me pick this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the heck does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you usually wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got any pics?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's the one I showed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,See? None of them fit right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fit's not the problem.\NIt's your fashion sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The happy peace sign makes it so much sadder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm gonna tell her that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:01.67,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,151.2)}{\an7}COSPLAYER STORYTIME: END
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's the elf lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have her undies!\NI gotta give her her undies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean her ruffle shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't go shouting 'undies,' girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's hard to tell who's who out of costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She said you could keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... Let me go try to find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got to get going,\Nbut thank you all so much for all your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lilliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hope we'll see you at Summer Comiket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Summer Comiket...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she didn't have any socials or a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope we see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Summer Comiket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:11.96,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,79.2)}{\an7}RIRISA AMANO
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:11.96,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,374.4)}{\an7}They kicked us out so I’m waiting at the station.\N{\pos(204.8,525.6)}{\an7}OK, I’ll be there in a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry that took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure you're good?\NThere's another train in 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elf lady! Elf lady, are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elf lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you're looking for an elf lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, she had long ears...\NActually, probably not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Long ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's an elf lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen an elf lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elf! Elf lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:52.83,Q4,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elf! Elf lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen an elf lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elf lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you be quiet?! You're embarrassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm the 'elf lady.'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,E-elf lady, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I work at an office nearby, so zip those lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one would guess she's an otaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make sure I returned them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could've kept them, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd your first cosrom fare?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, we made a bunch of mistakes,\Nand ended up not selling a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your first one's always a bomb, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura sold zero copies for her first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's inspired me to make an incredible cosrom,\Njust like hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Where was she today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura probably isn't going to cosplay events anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Is she quitting cosplay for good?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's trying to wash her hands of it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What, like cosplay's a criminal record?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things are just tougher when\Nyou're older and have a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll tell her you say hi, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, is Mayura that one cosplayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, she did Milky Succubus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good then... Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We didn't sell any DVDs,\Nand her inspiration just up and quit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-how do I make her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:19:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I keep going to events,\NI'm sure I'll run into her again someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I want to see all my new friends again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai! I want to go to Summer Comiket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Summer Comiket?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things didn't work out today,\Nbut I want to keep making even better cosroms,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and keep going to more events!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good. Guess I didn't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's been holding\Nonto this dream for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. Why're you even asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The only reason I got to make a cosrom\Nand go to an event is because you helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not true. You put in a ton of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could only do it because you were there helping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Without you, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've... I've noticed I feel a little\Nweird around you lately, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,My heart starts to beat fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,and when you kept me safe that one time,\Nmy chest felt really tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nwhen I'm alone with her, I feel weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So it's not just me?! Does that mean we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what it was before,\Nbut today I finally figured out what I'm feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I think it's important that I tell you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, this feeling is love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I love having you as my cosplay partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It all made sense after the event today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I've found a\Nphotographer as amazing as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She loves having me as a partner!\NYep, that makes total sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I wasn't feeling anything romantic towards her, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was jealous because I'm her photographer, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.21,0:22:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My heart races around him 'cause\NI've got so much respect for him as a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here I was getting worried I'd fallen in love with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I'd be the one making\Nour relationship complicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank god!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:25.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,108)}{\an7}THEY’RE BOTH IDIOTS.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,388.8)}{\an7}Senpai's Secret Special Training!?
